@backend_stepkind_HostAddress = http://localhost:5278

### Create tutorial
POST {{backend_stepkind_HostAddress}}/api/tutorials
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "tut-001",
  "name": "Intro a ASP.NET Core",
  "url": "https://example.com/tutorial/aspnet-intro",
  "description": "Tutorial básico de ASP.NET Core",
  "transcript": "Este es el contenido completo del tutorial..."
}

### List tutorials
GET {{backend_stepkind_HostAddress}}/api/tutorials

### Get tutorial by id
GET {{backend_stepkind_HostAddress}}/api/tutorials/tut-001

### Reindex tutorial embeddings
POST {{backend_stepkind_HostAddress}}/api/tutorials/tut-001/reindex

### Semantic search
POST {{backend_stepkind_HostAddress}}/api/search/semantic
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "cómo configurar EF Core con PostgreSQL",
  "topK": 5
}
